NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000502 "L<Mastering Algorithms with Perl|http://shop.oreilly.com/product/9781565923980.do>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000503 "from L<O'Reilly|http://www.oreilly.com>: for the inspiration (and much of the"
