NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000506 "for all sizes of array was not published until 1962.>\" (A summary of a passage"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000507 "from Knuth: Sorting and Searching, 6.2.1.)"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000508 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000509 "I<Although the basic idea of binary search is comparatively straightforward,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000510 "the details can be surprisingly tricky...>  -- Donald Knuth"
